<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Julius Baer.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Julius Baer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG said it has issued five million American-style call warrants on bearer shares of Julius Baer Holding AG.</p>
<p>One warrant controls fifty shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,800 CHF		 PREMIUM	11.08 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.30 CHF		  GEARING	15.1 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 08.APR.97-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	03.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,723 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
